      "id": 225815,
      "name": "degausser",
      "username": "degausser",
      "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/d/9fc29f/{size}.png",
      "created_at": "2019-03-02T08:41:56.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Updated with a few I missed from Season 1 character creation.&nbsp; Not much information on them, (Principle of the Lab and Principle of the indestructable.)&nbsp; I seem to recall Bubbles also had principle of . . . immortality I think?&nbsp; Longevity?&nbsp; If anyone can remember, please let me know.</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>Here's my thoughts on some solo heroes?</p>\n<p>Stuntman: Principle of Ambition, Principle of the tactician (at least when he was Ambuscade.&nbsp; Stuntman seems far more reckless.)</p>\n<p>Guise: Principle of Levity.&nbsp; Principle of the I win at everything.&nbsp; (Or Principle of Whispers, explaining his 'knowledge' of the fourth wall.)</p>\n<p>Parse: Principle of the Gearhead (more for computer stuf than Engineering stuff), Principle of Clockwork</p>\n<p>Chrono-Ranger/Time-Slinger: Principle of the Time Traveler, Principle of Order (Or Principle of the hero)</p>",
      "post_number": 6,
      "post_type": 1,
      "updated_at": "2021-02-07T05:59:33.218Z",
      "reply_count": 0,
      "reply_to_post_number": null,
