      "created_at": "2019-03-05T09:31:01.000Z",
      "cooked": "<aside class=\"quote no-group\" data-username=\"degausser\">\n<div class=\"title\">\n<div class=\"quote-controls\"></div>\n<img loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/d/9fc29f/48.png\" class=\"avatar\"> degausser:</div>\n<blockquote>\n<p>Parse: Principle of the Gearhead (more for computer stuf than Engineering stuff), Principle of Clockwork</p>\n</blockquote>\n</aside>\n<p>I feel Principle of the Tactition would suit her better.&nbsp; That’s how she acts in the card game after all and the most she deals with tech is in her background.</p>",
